  "content": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n![Line](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dd7e30a42d1fd63e0b5d9fd08b2479e3519ec97a.webp)\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6b4ee6a132c230c4808e253a189db9ac6e5398c0.gif\" width=\"800\" alt=\"HyperPunchy 标志\">\n\n<br/>\n\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jg4P72EVkh\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e3af1c09ba928d704d30b521fabe0690e9e51f1.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"50\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@hypdev\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3adf0adb90d27808bb64d4e4599235df84d05612.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"50\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/hamz_\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/17ac3e91ab87f0fa1c54ad7533b45225b0b7c7f3.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"50\">\n  </a>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n**为 Punchy 体验量身打造的终极资源包。**\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eTmu74gIPA4\" title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n![Line](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dd7e30a42d1fd63e0b5d9fd08b2479e3519ec97a.webp)\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81e14a622c69a2e5ddb7ed33a98e38396612268c_0.webp\" width=\"0\" style=\"display:block; border:none;\">\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border:none; border-collapse:collapse; background:transparent;\">\n<tr>\n<td width=\"600\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"border:none;\">\n\n<br>\n\n**概述**\n\nHyperPunchy 旨在现代化标准动画和纹理，提供更流畅、响应更快的游戏体验。它专为改善高速战斗和移动机制中的视觉反馈而设计，确保每个动作都充满冲击力。\n\n<br>\n\n**主要特性**\n\n* **超过100种自定义动画：** 通过独特的手工制作动作，对核心体验进行大规模革新。\n* **无缝过渡：** 优化动画状态，避免“卡顿”，确保视觉流程连贯。\n* **现代化纹理：** 精炼的视觉效果，在保持经典 Minecraft 精神的同时增添现代感。\n* **面向未来的设计：** 优化的内部结构，为即将推出的复杂动画更新做好准备。\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"400\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:none;\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/606add918448d82f2cf28fb8c180931085f792ff_0.webp\" width=\"300\" style=\"display:block; border:none;\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n\n> [!提示] 为了获得最佳体验，我们建议使用 **Iris/Oculus** 以及最新版本的 **Sodium**。\n\n![Line](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dd7e30a42d1fd63e0b5d9fd08b2479e3519ec97a.webp)\n\n<br>\n\n<div>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3ac088c5b2259e0e679a7ff75b8df452f35eefcf_0.webp\" alt=\"Punchy\" width=\"250\"></a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/55506aec00f8db10edb1f93b923bf4c76aae3c19_0.webp\" alt=\"Respackopts\" width=\"250\"></a>\n\n</div>\n\n***还需要下载这个。***\n\n需要 Respackopts 来配置资源包设置。\n\n <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/18334a59a27759d90a328085cc3293564ae5de22.png\" width=\"700\" style=\"display:block; border:none;\">\n\n<br>\n\n![Line](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dd7e30a42d1fd63e0b5d9fd08b2479e3519ec97a.webp)\n\n### 许可证与致谢\n**许可证：** 保留所有权利（ARR）。未经明确许可，严禁重新分发或修改。\n\n**平台：** 专为 Modrinth 社区设计。\n\n  <sub>HyperPunchy 是一个独立项目，旨在增强“Punchy”体验。</sub>\n</div>",
